{"id":"02c10d5d18aba717","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kleene-post.md","title":"0′ 以下的 Kleene–Post 不可比构造","display":"thm-kleene-post — 0′ 以下的 Kleene–Post 不可比构造","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kleene-post","aliases":["20-thm-kleene-post"],"display":"thm-kleene-post — 0′ 以下的 Kleene–Post 不可比构造","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.1.1","source_printed_pages":[132,133],"source_pdf_pages":[166,167],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-use]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kleene-post"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kleene-post</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-post — 0′ 以下的 Kleene–Post 不可比构造"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>132</span><span>133</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>166</span><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用上游二进制有限串及有限 oracle 计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 判定普通 c.e. 的存在性问题。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land A\\not\\le_TB\\land B\\not\\le_TA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land A\\not\\le_TB\\land B\\not\\le_TA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明。交替处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\">\\(A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\ne\\Phi_e^A\">\\(B\\ne\\Phi_e^A\\)</span>，维护只增不改的前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span>。处理前者时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\sigma|\">\\(n=|\\sigma|\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 判断是否有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\tau\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\tau\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\rho(n)\\downarrow=y\">\\(\\Phi_e^\\rho(n)\\downarrow=y\\)</span>。若有，按固定有效顺序取第一个停止见证，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:=\\rho\">\\(\\tau:=\\rho\\)</span>，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(n)\">\\(\\sigma(n)\\)</span> 写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=0\">\\(y=0\\)</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne0\">\\(y\\ne0\\)</span>）；该位必异于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>。若无，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的任何无限延伸均在此输入发散，任意补上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(n)\">\\(\\sigma(n)\\)</span> 即可。对后者交换两列。</p>\n<p>每步再把两串延长至少一位；所有搜索与分支判定均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 中完成，故极限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A,B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。有限 use 保持已制造的不同，否定分支则永久保持发散，所以每个要求成立。不可比也推出两者均非可计算、均严格低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。这里不把非布尔输出的截断误当成一个可能相等的值。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.1.1；印刷页 132, 133；PDF 第 166, 167 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing'\\land B\\le_T\\varnothing'\\land A\\not\\le_TB\\land B\\not\\le_TA].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\ne\\Phi_e^B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\ne\\Phi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"n=|\\sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\succeq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^\\rho(n)\\downarrow=y","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:=\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(n)","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"y=0","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"y\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\le_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false}],"bytes":2076,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e213c2da24d86eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"562aa6d95dcc4d4d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。"},{"id":"133865925995a5f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-thm-kleene-post]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-d